{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wake up in the void, with no memory other than the deep sense that something horrible has happened to you in life that has left you in limbo. Can you find your way back to the living to make things right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Should you?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my first visual novel / game project, The River. I actually made something!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my very first attempt at making a game, as well as my first second earnest attempt at a cohesive, stand-alone narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set off to create all of the visual assets, sound effects, and music myself, and scripting/tying it all together with Adventure Game Studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time:\u00a030-50\u00a0minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with good Audio\u00a0/\u00a0Headphones is highly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Warning: Contains mature\u00a0subject matter\u00a0(discussion of\u00a0death\u00a0and dying, written\u00a0descriptions of\u00a0violence)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique,\u00a0(mostly)\u00a0monochrome\u00a0style\u00a0visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital\u00a0hand-drawn\u00a0backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique soundtrack and dynamic music score for\u00a0each of the game's\u00a012\u00a0scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly\u00a02000\u00a0frames of sprite animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Novel\u00a0styled story, including dialog\u00a0and character portraits</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Other Side","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3747970/ba57262a498411c7fffd323f7c176bb38866bb4e.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747970?t=1750635285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747970/c6017655307c0eeb6d1a6581bdd155b3d207e326/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750635285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747970/f79912fe0cb29aa57bc62adcb54034f76a0eeb3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750635285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747970/f79912fe0cb29aa57bc62adcb54034f76a0eeb3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750635285","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Dialogue describing violent story events and death."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wake up in the void, with no memory other than the deep sense that something horrible has happened to you in life that has left you in limbo. Can you find your way back to the living to make things right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Should you?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my first visual novel / game project, The River. I actually made something!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my very first attempt at making a game, as well as my first second earnest attempt at a cohesive, stand-alone narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set off to create all of the visual assets, sound effects, and music myself, and scripting/tying it all together with Adventure Game Studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time:\u00a030-50\u00a0minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing with good Audio\u00a0/\u00a0Headphones is highly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Warning: Contains mature\u00a0subject matter\u00a0(discussion of\u00a0death\u00a0and dying, written\u00a0descriptions of\u00a0violence)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique,\u00a0(mostly)\u00a0monochrome\u00a0style\u00a0visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital\u00a0hand-drawn\u00a0backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique soundtrack and dynamic music score for\u00a0each of the game's\u00a012\u00a0scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly\u00a02000\u00a0frames of sprite animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Novel\u00a0styled story, including dialog\u00a0and character portraits</p></li></ul>","developers":["bokchoi"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747970/665904e36f1c3ef6f3dd2bc6f890dfa3d8dfa6a3/header.jpg?t=1750635285","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747970/995352532/997004c761ace475db0d0b725f12f05cee182141/1750387257/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748026705","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747970/995352532/997004c761ace475db0d0b725f12f05cee182141/1750387257/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748026705","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3747970/995352532/997004c761ace475db0d0b725f12f05cee182141/1750387257/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748026705","id":257143186,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143186/movie480.mp4?t=1748026705","max":"https://video.akamai.